  "review_questions": [
    "Does the proposed concept identify Initial Condition narrowly enough to prevent a different scientific quantity from matching?",
    "Are the allowed representations complete, and can any two allowed representations connect without an explicit adapter?",
    "Which authoritative standards, ontologies, databases or primary publications support each required field and comparison rule?",
    "Which missing value must return UNKNOWN, and which known contradiction must return INCOMPATIBLE?",
    "Should quantity, unit, scale, normalization, baseline or endpoint be required for this profile?",
    "Does this profile need a versioned identifier namespace or an ordered feature universe?",
    "Should axes, labels, feature order, coordinates or artifact schema be required for non-scalar values?",
    "What uses and scientific claims must this profile explicitly exclude?"
  ],
  "scientific_claim": "This profile checks whether two model interfaces fit together. It doesn't show that a model is scientifically valid or clinically safe.",
